High-Tensile Nylon Belt Anchorage:
High-tensile nylon belts are essential components in securing the bike parcel during transportation. Their high tensile strength ensures that the belts can withstand the forces exerted during transit without breaking or slipping, preventing the bike parcel from shifting or becoming dislodged. High-tensile nylon belts can absorb impact forces and distribute them evenly across the package, further protecting the bicycle.

The nylon belts feature a strong adhesive coating that enables secure attachment to the bike parcel, ensuring the bicycle remains anchored within the package during transit. When securing the bike parcel, the belts are looped around the package and firmly attached to specific points on the bicycle, preventing any unwanted movement inside the package.

