<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Zaidpur | Insured Two-Wheeler Shipping UP
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure my bike arrives scratch‑free during transportation in Zaidpur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We combine a hydraulic loading ramp, high‑tensile nylon belt anchorage, and a proprietary 7‑layer bubble packaging system. Each layer cushions impacts, while the belt secures the bike against movement. Our drivers follow a strict zero‑scratch protocol, and live GPS tracking lets you monitor the journey in real time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for a bike parcel shipment from Zaidpur to another city?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You need a valid bike registration certificate, a government‑issued ID, a GST‑compliant invoice (if applicable), and a completed e‑Way bill. Our team prepares an IBA‑approved claim bill, which is accepted for corporate reimbursements and government transfers, ensuring a hassle‑free clearance process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I ship my scooter or moped using the same bike transport service in Zaidpur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our specialized two‑wheeler carriers are designed for motorcycles, scooters, and mopeds of all sizes. The hydraulic ramp and custom crating options accommodate varying wheelbases, and the same 7‑layer protection and insurance coverage apply to ensure safe delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a difference between bike transport by IRCTC and Shree Ashirwad’s door‑to‑door service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">IRCTC’s railway parcel service requires you to drop off and collect the bike at railway stations, with limited handling control. Shree Ashirwad offers full door‑to‑door pickup, dedicated hydraulic trailers, real‑time tracking, and a zero‑scratch guarantee, providing a more secure and convenient solution.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the price for bike transportation in Zaidpur calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on distance (approximately 850 km to major hubs), bike dimensions, required packaging (standard or wooden crate), and any additional services like express delivery. Our transparent quote process breaks down each cost component, so you know exactly what you’re paying for before booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What happens if my bike gets damaged during transit despite the safety measures?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All shipments are covered by 100% declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. In the unlikely event of damage, you can file a claim using the IBA‑approved bill we provide. Our claims team processes reimbursements quickly, ensuring you are fully compensated.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
